    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• A broken stroke may become several glyphs; two touching runes may become one glyph.\n• Each template has its own soft thresholds and allowRotation setting."
